{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52585","headline":"五言翫花莺一首 · 智藏","name":"五言翫花莺一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桑门寡言晤，策杖事迎逢。\n以此芳春节，忽值竹林风。\n求友莺嫣（一作「娇」）树，含香花笑丛。\n虽喜遨游志，还媿乏雕虫。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"智藏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52585.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52585","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}